# Old marketing pages of the previous site → new home
/home / 301
/demo / 301
/plans /#start 301
/pricing /#start 301
/features / 301
/about /#team 301
/contact / 301
/legal/privacy https://app.leaddrivecrm.org/legal/privacy?lang=en 302
/legal/terms https://app.leaddrivecrm.org/legal/terms?lang=en 302
/legal/data-deletion https://app.leaddrivecrm.org/legal/data-deletion?lang=en 302
# 302, not 301: this catch-all is a fallback for paths we have not mapped yet,
# and a 301 is cached by the browser for ever. Before the three rules above
# existed, /legal/privacy fell through to here, and visitors who opened it then
# still get sent to the home page from their own cache no matter what the
# server now answers. A fallback must never be permanent.
/legal / 302
/legal/* / 302
/landing / 301
/landing/* / 301
/marketing / 301
/marketing/* / 301
